# Paper2Play needs no API key and performs no model inference.
# Application ports are fixed: web 4209, API 5209, bound to 127.0.0.1.
# No .env loader or model-provider variables are used by this MVP.
# Optional shell environment for Playwright only:
# PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH=/path/to/your/compatible/browser-cache
# Default browser cache is repository-local .browsers/.
# Optional shell override: PLAYWRIGHT_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/path/to/chromium
